Subject: [PATCH 06892/11362] [outer-loop] ARC ka59 round-6: honest null,
 helper ballistics confirmed directional

Round-6 codex gpt-5.6-sol attempt on ka59 fixed round-5's tooling bug and
got real L7 exploration. Confirmed the helper-to-helper ballistics from
round 4 generalize but are DIRECTIONAL: a selected horizontal 6x3 helper
above the vertical 3x6 helper launches it downward through the lower
partition, but the inverse arrangement stayed blocked across every tested
alignment, momentum, and cycling-stack phase -- a real asymmetry. Also
found the rectangular helpers cannot relocate the lower cycling stack,
unlike L6's selected square.

Honest null -- no registry count change, frontier stays at level 6.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JntPrUGLNesPcJH1pyfFYw
